        <mxCell id="0eQYh__Nr1NXl_aDqaWm-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=2" value="&lt;strong&gt;•&lt;/strong&gt; To connect to a VM remotely, the user must be a member of the mandatory security group (for the Bastion service) and at least one optional security group for the relevant workload (spoke VM).&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;• &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;Th&lt;/span&gt;e target VM must have the AADSSHLoginForLinux extension installed.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="51" width="684" x="-994" y="980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
